The bug was caused by the driver only resending the `NVM_INSTALL_UPDATE` command when the initial command returned a success status, rather than also considering the specific error code `FRAG_ERR` returned by the firmware. This oversight meant that fragmentation errors were not handled correctly, preventing the command from being retried with the necessary defragmentation flags.

